"<strong>Not published:</strong> This guide is not available through its "
"public URL. Click Publish above to enable external access."
msgstr "<strong>未发布：</strong> 当前指南暂无法通过公开链接访问。点击上方“发布”以启用外部访问。"

#. module: knowledge_guide
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:knowledge_guide.view_knowledge_guide_book_form
