"<strong>Public URL:</strong> Once published, share the URL above with readers. They can open it without signing in.\n"
"                                The token protects access; regenerating it invalidates the old link."
msgstr ""
"<strong>公开链接：</strong> 发布后，可将上方链接分享给读者，无需登录即可打开。\n"
"                                Token 用于保护访问权限；重新生成 Token 会使旧链接失效。"

